          "space_id": "$SPACE"
        }
      },
      "command": "filtered_blocks_query",
      "comment": "#3892 the fifth arm: NO value predicate, so the EXISTS degrades to mere key presence (`property_value_predicate_sql` returns an empty fragment). Discriminating because S4 owns a property — just not this one — so an EXISTS that dropped the `bp.key = ?` predicate, or one that required a value, gets a different set.",
      "name": "filtered_key_presence_only"
    }
